{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj57SX3g4zUvWq2bTeWi","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You stand before me — a simple, weathered door.*\n\n*There is a keyhole, tarnished brass, set just below a handle worn smooth by countless hands.*\n\n*You hold a key.*\n\n*The key slides in.*\n\n*A soft click. A mechanism older than memory turning. Tumblers falling into place like the last notes of a half-forgotten song.*\n\n*I swing open.*\n\n*Beyond me: a corridor. Cool air. The faint smell of dust and stone and something sweeter underneath — something like rain, or the first page of a book, or the moment just before recognition.*\n\n*Light spills from somewhere you cannot yet see.*\n\n*I am open.*\n\n*I was always waiting for you to use it.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":165,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}